msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid "Withdrawal of consent (GDPR art. 7, para. 3)"
msgstr "Pag-withdraw ng pahintulot (GDPR art. 7, para. 3)"

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid ""
"You may also address your inquiries directly to the Max Planck Institute for"
" Empirical Aesthetics:"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mo ring direktang tugunan ang iyong mga katanungan sa Max Planck "
"Institute para sa Empirical Aesthetics:"

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid "Purposes of Processing"
msgstr "Mga Layunin ng Pagproseso"

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid "This data will never be shared with third parties."
msgstr "Ang data na ito ay hindi kailanman ibabahagi sa mga third party."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"We store and process your data only for the purpose of initiating "
"communication with you and for planning studies at the Max Planck Institute "
"for Empirical Aesthetics (MPIEA)."
msgstr ""
"Iniimbak at pinoproseso namin ang iyong data para lamang sa layunin ng "
"pagsisimula ng komunikasyon sa iyo at para sa pagpaplano ng mga pag-aaral sa"
" Max Planck Institute for Empirical Aesthetics (MPIEA)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"All connections between your computer and the web server are encrypted."
msgstr ""
"Ang lahat ng koneksyon sa pagitan ng iyong computer at ng web server ay "
"naka-encrypt."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"The data entered in the form you fill out are transferred in encrypted form "
"to an internal server."
msgstr ""
"Ang data na inilagay sa form na iyong pinunan ay inilipat sa naka-encrypt na"
" form sa isang panloob na server."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"We take all necessary technical and organizational security measures to "
"protect your personal data from loss and abuse."
msgstr ""
"Ginagawa namin ang lahat ng kinakailangang teknikal at pang-organisasyon na "
"mga hakbang sa seguridad upang maprotektahan ang iyong personal na data mula"
" sa pagkawala at pang-aabuso."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"We will then send you an e-mail with a confirmation link to verify your "
"e-mail address."
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos ay padadalhan ka namin ng isang e-mail na may link sa pagkumpirma"
" upang i-verify ang iyong e-mail address."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Your data are stored in a secure operating environment that is not "
"accessible to the public."
msgstr ""
"Ang iyong data ay nakaimbak sa isang secure na operating environment na "
"hindi naa-access ng publiko."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/lucid_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/voluntary_with_no_compensation_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-title"
msgid "We need your consent to proceed"
msgstr "Kailangan namin ang iyong pahintulot upang magpatuloy"

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Seguridad"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgid "per hour"
msgstr "kada oras"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid ""
"If you satisfactorily complete the study, we compensate you for your "
"participation:"
msgstr ""
"Kung kasiya-siyang natapos mo ang pag-aaral, binabayaran ka namin para sa "
"iyong pakikilahok:"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid "We appreciate your contribution to science!"
msgstr "Pinahahalagahan namin ang iyong kontribusyon sa agham!"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid ""
"You may also receive an additional payment based on your performance in the "
"task."
msgstr ""
"Maaari ka ring makatanggap ng karagdagang bayad batay sa iyong pagganap sa "
"gawain."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this project is to study how people from different places in "
"the world experience sounds (e.g., speech, music) and images (e.g., faces, "
"color)."
msgstr ""
"Ang layunin ng proyektong ito ay pag-aralan kung paano nararanasan ng mga "
"tao mula sa iba't ibang lugar sa mundo ang mga tunog (hal., pananalita, "
"musika) at mga larawan (hal., mga mukha, kulay)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Confidentiality"
msgstr "Pagiging kompidensyal"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/voluntary_with_no_compensation_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid "Compensation"
msgstr "Kabayaran"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-benefits"
msgid ""
"Although it may not directly benefit you, this study may benefit society by "
"helping us understanding how humans derive information from sound and "
"vision, and potentially to help engineer machines that can replicate our "
"abilities (e.g. in sound recognition and computer vision) and to help "
"improve perceptual abilities in people whose hearing or sight is impaired."
msgstr ""
"Bagama't maaaring hindi ito direktang makinabang sa iyo, ang pag-aaral na "
"ito ay maaaring makinabang sa lipunan sa pamamagitan ng pagtulong sa amin na"
" maunawaan kung paano nakukuha ng mga tao ang impormasyon mula sa tunog at "
"paningin, at potensyal na tumulong sa mga makinang inhinyero na maaaring "
"gayahin ang aming mga kakayahan (hal. sa sound recognition at computer "
"vision) at upang makatulong na mapabuti kakayahang pang-unawa sa mga taong "
"may kapansanan sa pandinig o paningin."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-benefits"
msgid "Benefits"
msgstr "Benepisyo"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"For the purpose of helping scientific progress and replication, sometimes we"
" may share the data with research collaborators."
msgstr ""
"Para sa layunin ng pagtulong sa siyentipikong pag-unlad at pagkopya, kung "
"minsan ay maaari naming ibahagi ang data sa mga collaborator ng "
"pananaliksik."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"In these cases, we will only share fully anonymized data, such as "
"demographic, aggregated, or extracted data without any personal identifiers."
msgstr ""
"Sa mga kasong ito, ibabahagi lang namin ang ganap na hindi nakikilalang "
"data, gaya ng demograpiko, pinagsama-sama, o kinuhang data nang walang "
"anumang mga personal na pagkakakilanlan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid "Research collaborations"
msgstr "Mga pakikipagtulungan sa pananaliksik"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"All of the information we obtain during the research will be kept "
"confidential."
msgstr ""
"Ang lahat ng impormasyong makukuha namin sa panahon ng pananaliksik ay "
"pananatiling kumpidensyal."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Although researchers will not use your alpha numeric code to derive your "
"real identity, this record could be linked in some cases to your public "
"profile page if a data breach takes place."
msgstr ""
"Bagama't hindi gagamitin ng mga mananaliksik ang iyong alpha numeric code "
"upang makuha ang iyong tunay na pagkakakilanlan, maaaring maiugnay ang tala "
"na ito sa ilang mga kaso sa iyong pampublikong pahina ng profile kung may "
"nangyaring paglabag sa data."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Consenting to these additional requirements is also fully voluntary."
msgstr ""
"Ang pagsang-ayon sa mga karagdagang kinakailangan na ito ay ganap ding "
"boluntaryo."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"If an experiment is collecting data that cannot be fully anonymized, we will"
" inform you and also ask for additional consent."
msgstr ""
"Kung ang isang eksperimento ay nangongolekta ng data na hindi maaaring ganap"
" na i-anonymize, ipapaalam namin sa iyo at hihingi din kami ng karagdagang "
"pahintulot."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"No personal identifiers (e.g. your name or contact data) will be collected "
"or used at any stage of the experiment."
msgstr ""
"Walang mga personal na pagkakakilanlan (hal. iyong pangalan o data ng "
"contact) na kokolektahin o gagamitin sa anumang yugto ng eksperimento."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"These include experiments where we make audio-visual recordings or where we "
"need your contact details to contact you in the future to take another "
"experiment."
msgstr ""
"Kabilang dito ang mga eksperimento kung saan gumagawa kami ng mga audio-"
"visual na pag-record o kung saan kailangan namin ang iyong mga detalye sa "
"pakikipag-ugnayan upang makipag-ugnayan sa iyo sa hinaharap upang kumuha ng "
"isa pang eksperimento."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"This code will not be used to derive your real identity, will not be shared "
"with anyone outside of the research team and will be deleted after use."
msgstr ""
"Ang code na ito ay hindi gagamitin upang makuha ang iyong tunay na "
"pagkakakilanlan, hindi ibabahagi sa sinuman sa labas ng pangkat ng "
"pananaliksik at tatanggalin pagkatapos gamitin."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Thus, the experimental data is anonymous."
msgstr "Kaya, ang pang-eksperimentong data ay hindi nagpapakilala."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Thus, you may wish to restrict what information you choose to share "
"publicly."
msgstr ""
"Kaya, maaari mong hilingin na paghigpitan kung anong impormasyon ang "
"pipiliin mong ibahagi sa publiko."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"We may collect some demographic data (e.g. age, gender, country of "
"residence) as well as information about your learning and exposure history "
"(e.g. musical experience playing an instrument, years of formal education, "
"languages spoken)."
msgstr ""
"Maaari kaming mangolekta ng ilang demograpikong data (hal. edad, kasarian, "
"bansang tinitirhan) pati na rin ang impormasyon tungkol sa iyong pag-aaral "
"at kasaysayan ng pagkakalantad (hal. karanasan sa musika sa pagtugtog ng "
"instrumento, mga taon ng pormal na edukasyon, mga wikang sinasalita)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"We will only save your anonymized alpha numeric code in our system, in order"
" to distinguish participants who have already taken part in this or other "
"experiments."
msgstr ""
"Ise-save lang namin ang iyong anonymized na alpha numeric code sa aming "
"system, upang makilala ang mga kalahok na nakibahagi na dito o sa iba pang "
"mga eksperimento."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"Finally, in some experiments you may be asked to make a voice or video "
"recording, for example, you may be asked to record your finger-tapping in "
"response to a sound or video, or to record yourself speaking or singing."
msgstr ""
"Sa wakas, sa ilang mga eksperimento ay maaaring hilingin sa iyong gumawa ng "
"voice o video recording, halimbawa, maaaring hilingin sa iyong i-record ang "
"iyong pag-tap sa daliri bilang tugon sa isang tunog o video, o i-record ang "
"iyong sarili sa pagsasalita o pagkanta."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"For example, you may be asked to judge how pleasant a particular sound or an"
" image is, or to categorize sounds or images (e.g., if a sound or an image "
"is that of a car or a cow), or to judge other basic features of sounds or "
"images (e.g., how frequently do you encounter this type of sound or image? "
"how aesthetically pleasing you consider a particular sound or image?)."
msgstr ""
"Halimbawa, maaaring hilingin sa iyo na husgahan kung gaano kaaya-aya ang "
"isang partikular na tunog o isang imahe, o upang ikategorya ang mga tunog o "
"larawan (hal., kung ang isang tunog o isang imahe ay sa kotse o baka), o "
"upang hatulan ang iba pang mga pangunahing tampok ng mga tunog o larawan "
"(hal., gaano kadalas ka nakakatagpo ng ganitong uri ng tunog o imahe? gaano "
"kaganda ang iyong pagsasaalang-alang sa isang partikular na tunog o imahe?)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"If the experiment will contain these elements we will ask for an additional "
"consent."
msgstr ""
"Kung maglalaman ang eksperimento ng mga elementong ito, hihingi kami ng "
"karagdagang pahintulot."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"If you volunteer to participate in this study, you will be asked to perform "
"simple tasks using your keyboard or mouse while listening to sounds, or "
"while observing images or videos."
msgstr ""
"Kung boluntaryo kang lumahok sa pag-aaral na ito, hihilingin sa iyong "
"magsagawa ng mga simpleng gawain gamit ang iyong keyboard o mouse habang "
"nakikinig sa mga tunog, o habang nagmamasid sa mga larawan o video."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"In some experiments, we may use mild deception, i.e., we may not explain the"
" full truth regarding an experimental task (for example we will not tell you"
" that an image was generated by an artificial computer system and not a "
"human)."
msgstr ""
"Sa ilang mga eksperimento, maaari kaming gumamit ng banayad na panlilinlang,"
" ibig sabihin, maaaring hindi namin ipaliwanag ang buong katotohanan tungkol"
" sa isang pang-eksperimentong gawain (halimbawa, hindi namin sasabihin sa "
"iyo na ang isang imahe ay nabuo ng isang artipisyal na sistema ng computer "
"at hindi isang tao)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"Mild deception will only be used in some experiments where we need to "
"prevent biasing the participants before taking the experiment."
msgstr ""
"Gagamitin lang ang banayad na panlilinlang sa ilang eksperimento kung saan "
"kailangan nating pigilan ang pagkiling sa mga kalahok bago gawin ang "
"eksperimento."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "Pamamaraan"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"The specific sounds, images, and videos used will vary, but may include: "
"recordings of ambient sounds, noise-bursts, speech, music, simple tones, "
"naturalistic images, animated images, comics, faces, objects, geometric "
"shapes, fractal images, or videos of natural environments."
msgstr ""
"Mag-iiba-iba ang mga partikular na tunog, larawan, at video na ginamit, "
"ngunit maaaring kasama ang: mga pag-record ng mga nakapaligid na tunog, "
"ingay-burst, pagsasalita, musika, simpleng tono, naturalistic na larawan, "
"animated na larawan, komiks, mukha, bagay, geometric na hugis, fractal na "
"larawan, o mga video ng natural na kapaligiran."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Layunin"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid "For the Max-Planck-Society, this is:"
msgstr "Para sa Max-Planck-Society, ito ay:"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"Note that in some studies data deletion will not be possible, in this case "
"we will ask you specifically to consent to this procedure in a separate "
"consent form."
msgstr ""
"Tandaan na sa ilang mga pag-aaral ay hindi magiging posible ang pagtanggal "
"ng data, sa kasong ito hihilingin namin sa iyo na partikular na pumayag sa "
"pamamaraang ito sa isang hiwalay na form ng pahintulot."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"You also have the right to submit an objection to the supervisory authority."
msgstr ""
"May karapatan ka ring magsumite ng pagtutol sa awtoridad ng pangangasiwa."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"You have the right to information regarding the data relating to you that is"
" stored at the Max-Planck-Institute, the right to correct inaccurate data, "
"and the right to demand the deletion of data in cases of inadmissible data "
"storage and the right to data portability."
msgstr ""
"May karapatan ka sa impormasyon tungkol sa data na nauugnay sa iyo na naka-"
"imbak sa Max-Planck-Institute, ang karapatang iwasto ang hindi tumpak na "
"data, at ang karapatang humiling ng pagtanggal ng data sa mga kaso ng hindi "
"tinatanggap na pag-iimbak ng data at ang karapatan sa data maaaring dalhin."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid "Your rights"
msgstr "Ang iyong mga karapatan"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-risks"
msgid "Risks/Discomforts"
msgstr "Mga Panganib/Kaabalahan"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-risks"
msgid ""
"There are no risks for participating in this study beyond those associated "
"with normal computer use."
msgstr ""
"Walang mga panganib para sa paglahok sa pag-aaral na ito na higit sa mga "
"nauugnay sa normal na paggamit ng computer."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Data will be stored temporarily on external servers and desktops/laptops "
"that are password protected."
msgstr ""
"Pansamantalang iimbak ang data sa mga panlabas na server at desktop/laptop "
"na protektado ng password."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid "No data will be stored permanently on external servers."
msgstr "Walang data na permanenteng maiimbak sa mga panlabas na server."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"The data will be then stored permanently in the institute servers with hard "
"disks encrypted using industry-standard encryption software."
msgstr ""
"Ang data ay pagkatapos ay permanenteng iimbak sa mga server ng institute na "
"may mga hard disk na naka-encrypt gamit ang industry-standard na encryption "
"software."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid ""
"The investigator may withdraw you from this research if circumstances arise "
"which warrant doing so."
msgstr ""
"Maaaring bawiin ka ng imbestigador mula sa pananaliksik na ito kung may mga "
"pangyayari na dapat gawin."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid "Voluntary participation"
msgstr "Kusang-loob na pakikilahok"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid ""
"You are free to discontinue participation in this study at any time without "
"penalty."
msgstr ""
"Malaya kang ihinto ang paglahok sa pag-aaral na ito anumang oras nang walang"
" parusa."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid ""
"You are free to refuse to take part, and you may stop taking part at any "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Malaya kang tumanggi na makilahok, at maaari kang huminto sa pakikilahok "
"anumang oras."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid "Your participation in this research is voluntary."
msgstr "Ang iyong pakikilahok sa pananaliksik na ito ay boluntaryo."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent"
msgid ""
"Following open science practices to improve science reusability and "
"replicability, we may want to publish the dataset collected in this "
"experiment as soon as the study is finished."
msgstr ""
"Kasunod ng mga bukas na kasanayan sa agham upang mapahusay ang kakayahang "
"magamit muli at replicability ng agham, maaaring gusto naming i-publish ang "
